{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32549","headline":"山中有招 · 刘驾","name":"山中有招","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朗朗山月出，尘中事由生。\n人心虽不闲，九陌夜无行。\n学古以求闻，有如石上耕。\n齐姜早作妇，岂识闺中情。\n何如此幽居，地僻人不争。\n嘉树自昔有，茅屋因我成。\n取薪不出门，采药於前庭。\n春花虽无种，枕席芙蓉馨。\n君来食葵藿，天爵岂不荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}